    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d450">

                <pb facs="0542" n="454" sameAs="frus:frus1904/pg454"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Allen to Mr. Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Seoul,
                                Korea</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1904-02-27"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">February 27, 1904</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 681.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>:</p>
                <p rendition="#center">* * * * * * *</p>
                <p>Mr. Hayashi, the Japanese minister, during his call on yesterday afternoon handed
                    me a translation of the new agreement with Korea, a copy of which I
                        inclosed.<anchor n="a" xml:id="d450-f1"/></p>
                <p rendition="#center">* * * * * * *</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Horace N. Allen</hi>.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
